\subsection{Key Notation}
The recurring symbols of the controller layer are fixed once here; each is a
definition, not a constraint:
\begin{align*}
  d_b^{\text{NA}}  &\triangleq \text{estimated bus delay under NO\_ACTION (s)} \\
  d_b^{\delta}     &\triangleq \text{bus delay after action } \delta \text{ (s)} \\
  n_b              &\triangleq \text{bus occupancy (pax)} \\
  \Delta_{\text{car}}(\delta) &\triangleq \text{additional cross-traffic pax\,s caused by } \delta \\
  \bar{\tau}_{b,i} &\triangleq \text{scheduled (timetable) arrival of bus } b \text{ at } i \text{ (s)} \\
  \sigma_{b,i}     &\triangleq \text{schedule deviation } \tau_{b,i} - \bar{\tau}_{b,i} \text{ (steps, $+$ = late)} \\
  \sigma_{\text{in}}, \sigma_{\text{out}} &\triangleq \text{headway deviation before/after action (s)} \\
  \tau_{\text{late}} &\triangleq \text{lateness threshold, default 30\,s}
\end{align*}

