\hline
A: $Z_1$-net (this layer) & M3 guarded CellQLearn & Propose: CTM/Q scores; Commit: $\arg\min\Delta_{\text{net}}$ s.t.\ $Z_4$ veto, net-benefit test, and cascade & Minimise $Z_1$; $Z_4$ cap; $Z_2$ via cascade/Purdue approx; $Z_3$ via MIN\_GAIN/takeover \\
E: Learned Q-argmax & M2 CPD-QL & Propose $=$ commit: $\varepsilon$-greedy $\arg\max Q(s,a)$ on \cref{eq:cpd_reward}; analytic veto only, no hard net test & Maximise headway $+$ delay reward ($Z_1+Z_3$ blend, $w_h{=}0.5$); $Z_4$ veto only \\
B: Fair bargain & M4 Nash/GAME & Propose: HS durations; Commit: $\max$ product \cref{eq:ladder_nash} s.t.\ net test and $Z_4$ & Fairness across phases; $Z_1$ only as surplus accounting; downstream cost via cascade in cpc \\
